@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 7: Mobile Dashboard & Job Access (Flutter)

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Customer
actor Worker
actor "Serviqo Central Backend API" as Backend
actor "Realtime Socket Service" as Realtime

rectangle "Serviqo Flutter Mobile Application" {
  usecase "Maintain authenticated\nmobile session" as MaintainSession
  usecase "View role-based\nmobile dashboard" as Dashboard
  usecase "View active jobs and\nnotifications" as DashboardContent

  usecase "Create and manage\nservice requests" as ManageRequests
  usecase "Browse available jobs" as BrowseJobs
  usecase "Submit a bid" as SubmitBid

  usecase "Track job progress\nand status updates" as TrackJob
  usecase "Access messaging" as Messaging
  usecase "Access payment information" as PaymentInfo
}

Customer -- MaintainSession
Worker -- MaintainSession
Customer -- Dashboard
Worker -- Dashboard
Customer -- ManageRequests
Worker -- BrowseJobs
Worker -- SubmitBid
Customer -- TrackJob
Worker -- TrackJob
Customer -- Messaging
Worker -- Messaging
Customer -- PaymentInfo
Worker -- PaymentInfo

Dashboard ..> MaintainSession : <<include>>
Dashboard ..> DashboardContent : <<include>>
ManageRequests -- Backend
BrowseJobs -- Backend
SubmitBid -- Backend
TrackJob -- Backend
Messaging -- Backend
MaintainSession -- Backend
DashboardContent -- Backend
DashboardContent -- Realtime
TrackJob -- Realtime
Messaging -- Realtime
PaymentInfo -- Backend

note bottom of Dashboard
Mobile app features use the shared
Serviqo backend APIs and authenticated
sessions; the mobile client does not
maintain a separate marketplace backend.
end note

note right of PaymentInfo
Payment information access is part of
the supplied Module 7 requirements but
depends on Module 6, which is not yet
implemented. No payment capability is
currently available in the backend.
end note

note bottom of SubmitBid
Bid submission remains subject to
central backend rules, including worker
verification and job eligibility.
end note

@enduml
